NoMercy MediaServer

To start the server:
  systemctl --user enable nomercymediaserver.service
  systemctl --user start nomercymediaserver.service

The server runs as a user service. systemd stops it when your last session
ends and does not start it at boot. To keep it running without a login,
run this once (a server box, a NAS, an SSH-only machine):
  sudo loginctl enable-linger <your user>

For more information, visit: https://nomercy.tv
